@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR002: Manage Anomaly Transaction Alerts" as SAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics About Clients' Financial Situations" as FAFR003
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts" as CFR006
  usecase "CFR007: View Investment Opportunities Based on Risk Profile" as CFR007
  usecase "FAFR001: Manage Client Mentoring Sessions" as FAFR001
  usecase "SFR002: Deliver Personalized Recommendations to Users" as SFR002
  usecase "AIFR003: Generate Spending Limit Alerts Based on Unusual Deviations" as AIFR003
  usecase "CFR008: View News Related to Investment Portfolio" as CFR008
  usecase "SFR014: Generate Client Analytics for Financial Behavior and Performance" as SFR014
  usecase "AIFR009: Generate Predictive Insights on Future Analysis of Financial Situations" as AIFR009

  actor "Client" as Client
  actor "Financial Advisor" as FAdvisor
  actor "System Administrator" as SysAdmin
}

Client --> CFR001 : View financial insights dashboard\n(Client)
SysAdmin --> SAFR002, SAFR001 : Manage system parameters and alerts (SAFR Admin)
FAdvisor --> FAFR003, FAFR004, FAFR005: Provide client guidance based on predictive analytics\n(FA Advisor)
Client --> CFR006, SFR002, AIFR009 : Manage spending limits and receive recommendations (User)
FAdvisor --> SAFR001, FAFR003, FAFR004: Customize system settings for clients\n(FA Admin)
SysAdmin --> AIFR006, AIFR007, AIFR008 : Manage AI-generated alerts and insights (System Admin)

@enduml